{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119798","id":3752139279,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7fpRoP","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119798","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119798.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119798.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119798","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119798/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119798/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119798/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/c0bb5a2d1f372d05ece2263a3c0634ec5c909a62","number":119798,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix backspace being unable to delete pre-existing text in any input field when using a soft keyboard on Android.","user":{"login":"Voyend","id":146948396,"node_id":"U_kgDOCMJBLA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146948396?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend","html_url":"https://github.com/Voyend","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Voyend/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"When a virtual keyboard is shown, GodotEditText is seeded with only\r\nthe text before the cursor (mOriginText). The TextWatcher in\r\nGodotTextInputWrapper relies on this content changing to detect\r\nbackspace presses and forward KEYCODE_DEL to the engine.\r\n\r\nOnce the user backspaces through all the seeded content, the EditText\r\nbecomes empty. Any further backspace press (sent via sendKeyEvent by\r\nthe soft keyboard) calls super.onKeyDown(KEYCODE_DEL) on an empty\r\nEditText, which changes nothing, so beforeTextChanged() never fires\r\nand the engine receives no DEL event.\r\n\r\nResult:\r\n- Characters typed in the current session are deletable\r\n- Pre-existing text before the cursor can't be deleted\r\n- Workaround: re-tap the field (triggers showKeyboard() again,\r\n  reseeding the EditText)\r\n\r\nConfirmed with Unexpected Keyboard (uses sendKeyEvent for backspace),\r\nHacker's Keyboard, and Samsung Keyboard.\r\n\r\n### The fix\r\nForward KEYCODE_DEL directly to the engine inside onKeyDown() when\r\nthe EditText is empty. This is safe because:\r\n- beforeTextChanged() cannot fire on an empty EditText, so there is\r\n  no risk of double DEL events.\r\n- If the cursor is already at position 0, the engine ignores the\r\n  event gracefully, same as any other editor.\r\n\r\n### Testing\r\nOpen any TextEdit or LineEdit node on Android, try to move the cursor forward using the soft keyboard arrows or by sliding on the keyboard to the right on Samsung Keyboard. Type some text, then backspace past what you typed and into the original content. Should\r\nnow delete continuously without requiring a re-tap.\r\n\r\nFixes for Android #72969\r\n\r\nRelated: #68338","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310664,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA2NjQ=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:input","name":"topic:input","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","closed_at":null,"due_